# The shipping scene: "the race". One note, typed by hand and then spoken.
# The stage draws two notes side by side (race.rs): it uses this scene's
# keystrokes, its send and its timing, and the "With Utter" line below.

title   Team note
boss    Sam coral
lead    Same note, typed and spoken.

start
# A typo, noticed, and fixed.
careful Running ten minuet [pace 0.118]
wait    0.5
delete  2
careful tes late, start without me. I'll send the deck from the car. [pace 0.118]
wait    0.3
send
wait    0.6
end     removed

with
utter   Running ten minutes late, start without me. I'll send the deck from the car.
score   {utter} spoken, no typos, one note.
typed   Typing: {secs}, {typos}, and one note.
